  // Blocks fill map cells. Air is the only non-solid one; the rest are ground you stand on top of.
  // digWork is in work-ticks; 0 means the block can't be dug.
  // accent/accentFringe/accentAbove are cosmetic: a top texture shown in noise patches (wildflowers).
  // Materials are kinds of an item: wood from an oak is oak wood. Any kind pays a cost for the item,
  // and buildings take the look and name of what they were mostly built from. color tints art
  // that has no material-specific sprite (sprite name + "_" + lowercase material name).
  "materials": [
